#### `@CreateDateColumn`

Special column that is automatically set to the entity's insertion time.
You don't need to write a value into this column - it will be automatically set.
Example:

```typescript
@Entity()
export class User {
    @CreateDateColumn()
    createdDate: Date
}
```

